  <item>
    <title>021｜复杂世界的生存课：一个“老实人”的灰度觉醒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686fdd3d60f8f77d40e2a155</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686fdd3d60f8f77d40e2a155</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 20:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>💌【本期简介】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你也常被说“太老实”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果老实不是弱点，而是还没找到和复杂世界的相处方式呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期从半山和41的经历出发，聊聊“老实人”如何在这个复杂的世界中自处。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️【你会听到】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a>：小时候的我不理解：为什么这个世界上没有好人坏人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a>：你什么时候意识到，世界好像不是你想的那样简单？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a>：学生思维的我有着线性的因果逻辑，所以我坚信好人一定有好报。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a>：从《鱼，不存在》发觉人性的极端复杂。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a>：接受灰度不是变得“圆滑”，而是学会平衡、权衡、多角度看待事物。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a> ：实践厚黑学，会让我们变“坏”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> :【法则一】：不要盖过上司的光芒。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> : 【法则三】隐藏你的意图。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> : 【法则十六】用不确定性让人畏惧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1809">30:09</a> : 【法则四十八】假装没有规则才能驾驭所有规则。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> ：从电视剧《岁月》聊聊“老实人”的蜕变之路。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a> ：接受灰度就是诚实面对世界的混沌。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🌳【加入听友群】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4-GWX_4LZALJ-YByN1KyLlq802.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🌸【找到我们】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/58d087495e87e74433229e34?xsec_token=YBe6G9za3YUkYJFRnvBgAgsDuogMERuuw7kcN1lzrNGm8=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;