  <item>
    <title>019｜【得意忘形】之三亚见面会：打破凝固，做个“野人”！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677d34f81962f0b75109fc8c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677d34f81962f0b75109fc8c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jan 2025 14:14:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>💌【本期简介】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>2025年1月1日，半山和41参加了「得意忘形」张老师的三亚见面会，连接了很多有趣的朋友，收获了很多奇妙的能量。希望通过这期节目，把这份爱和能量流动给大家。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🎙️【你会听到】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 一个粉丝福利（后期补录的，有点像广告但真不是^_^꧞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 2024年，我们每个人都有自己的挣扎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 面对挣扎如何安顿自己的内心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 当你寄托希望于未来时，你便不在当下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> 自我成长是一场骗局？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 什么是无我的状态？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 时间是一切的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 一个非常自我的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> 如果身心是一个容器，你想在2025年给自己清空和加入什么东西？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 进行深度链接能给我们带来什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> 如何打破凝固的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 半山新年的一小突破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> 拿着自己的话筒走上舞台吧！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🎁【爱的流动】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>在本期节目评论区分享你的收听感受，我们将在2月1日选取一条走心评论，为你送上「得意忘形」见面会的物料——帆布包（如图）。希望我们在「有间房」里，继续扩张，继续爱。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPr9uC7D0VwAoMw61CMBmrNGiCf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（配图：星星哥）</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🌳【加入听友群】</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4-GWX_4LZALJ-YByN1KyLlq802.JPG"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>🌸【找到我们】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书/公众号@半山之地</span></p><span></span><p><span>即 &nbsp;刻@41在这儿</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🎵【片头尾BGM】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>《野人》安屿（版权来源：网易云音乐）</span></p>]]></description>
