  <item>
    <title>017｜在无序中抱着爱生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673f3ad48d1233fb0d00d83c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673f3ad48d1233fb0d00d83c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Nov 2024 14:03:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>💌【本期简介】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>一个多月的时间里，半山和41，从稳定的运动和静坐中，来到了无序而没有锚点的混沌里。我们聊到了恐惧、不安全感，以及在这其中，仍能尽力捕捉到的，充满生命力的时刻。祝愿大家：永远可以按照自己的直觉和内心的感受，去建立我们的生活。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🎙️【你会听到】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a>为什么要有社群，为什么要有同伴？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a>听了李辛老师的中医课，我开始天然地忠于自己的内心。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a>关于内在感受和外在物质的取舍。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a>常常在做的觉察练习：不去理会头脑的声音。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a>原来虚人也可以跑步？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a>顺应身体的节律，让运动自然进行。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a>安全感来自“今日无事发生”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a>恐惧和不安源于，我喜欢给事情下定义。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a>人可以抵抗生活的无序吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a>时刻保持觉知力的秘密武器是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a>评判让我的内心封闭，失去觉知。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1717">28:37</a>人大于事？还是事大于人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a>最近被滋养到的时刻。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🏷️【找到我们】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>小红书/公众号@半山之地</span></p><span></span><p><span>即 &nbsp;刻@41在这儿</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>📩【加入听友群】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4-GWX_4LZALJ-YByN1KyLlq802.JPG"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>🎵【片头尾BGM】：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>Force (Acoustic)（版权来源：网易云音乐）</span></p>]]></description>
