  <item>
    <title>016｜内观义工初体验：我只想生活的更好一点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fa7c7781cdab3a9326e8b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fa7c7781cdab3a9326e8b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 10:24:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>💌【本期简介】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>9月初半山和41去了郑州昙钟内观中心做义工，做义工和做学员有什么差别呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿和你分享这份快乐与能量。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️【你会听到】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a>萧集智老师是何许人也？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a>除静坐技法指导外，萧老师给我们带来的启发。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a>做服务的过程中，察觉到更多不曾被我留意到的习性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a>如何帮助我的父母朋友从无明和痛苦中解脱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a>什么是看见实相。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a>地上的究竟是不是麻绳？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a>头脑上的理解，有时候会变成一种知障。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a>你在追求奇幻体验吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a>听就是听，看就是看，梦就只是梦而已。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a>地狱不在别处。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2923">48:43</a>什么是宇宙间的最高频率？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2956">49:16</a>学会“随喜”他人，是一种什么感觉。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a>内观静坐，到底是为了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📩【加入听友群】：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsW6srv_LJRsSXDtYhwGIWaql18h.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>🏷️【找到我们】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书@半山之地</span></p><span></span><p><span>即 &nbsp;刻@41在这儿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵【片头尾BGM】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Agua de Estrellas》（版权来源：网易云音乐）</span></p>]]></description>
