  <item>
    <title>014｜咦！十日静坐内观后，今日方知我是我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668d04048fcadceb901681e4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668d04048fcadceb901681e4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jul 2024 09:33:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>💌【本期简介】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>半山和41在6月末参加了十日内观，愿和你分享我们最深的收获和触动。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️【你会听到】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a>什么是vipassana 内观？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a>为什么决定参加十日内观？以及到达内观中心后的第一感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a>上交手机、完全止语，会产生什么样的戒断反应？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a>原来通过身体这个载具，可以让我们深刻体验到，什么是无常。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a>快乐和愉悦的感受，其实也是一种“苦”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a>静坐是一种追求感受的游戏吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a>在静坐中，我们察觉到自己过往积累的旧习气。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a>什么是心的习性反应？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2844">47:24</a>如何从业力、习气、痛苦中解脱出来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3615">1:00:15</a>助理老师对“总是做噩梦”的开示。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵【片头尾BGM】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Trøllabundin》（版权来源：网易云音乐）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📩【加入听友群】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对静坐感兴趣，想培养对身心的觉知，欢迎加入我们的听友群分享你的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望可以看见你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿你快乐！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmGk-OjpGaUZWpYRlSYID0E5CaOQ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
